  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "公正轉型與全球公民社會",
    "sub_ename": "JUST TRANSITION AND GLOBAL CIVIL SOCIETY",
    "describe_ch": "公正轉型(正義過渡)正以全球化公民社會的密切關係，促動社會企業與社會團結經濟和永續發展目標的全面蓬勃發展，特別接軌跨國和公平正義之企業職能，以佈局在後2030和2050後全球願景。本課程以課堂教學、文件收集和個案分析等方式，期以瞭解並統整政治文化與社會經濟之經理管理架構，拓展整體商管社會事業經營理念，以強化建構學生進入職場之必要職能。",
    "describe_eh": "Just transition for global civil society as a fair and justice configuration and strategy in cultivating the integrated and transdisciplinary practices as a whole approach to sectoral and alternative economy. This course aims to explore this fundamental framework of references through case studies, literature review, and lecturing/presenting process.",
